\v 16 \w And Solomon| strong="H8010" \w* \w had horses| strong="H5483" \w* \w brought| strong="H4161" \w* \w out of Egypt| strong="H4714" \w*, \w and linen yarn| strong="H4723" \w*: [the king’s]{strong=“H4428”} [merchants]{strong=“H5503” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [received]{strong=“H3947” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the linen yarn| strong="H4723" \w* \w at a price| strong="H4242" \w*.\f + \fr 1:16 \ft Solomon…: Heb. the going forth of the horses which was Solomon’s \f* 
