\v 5 \w And the house| strong="H1004" \w* [which I build]{strong=“H1129” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} is \w great| strong="H1419" \w*: \w for great| strong="H1419" \w* is \w our God| strong="H430" \w* \w above all gods| strong="H430" \w*. 
\v 6 [But who is able]{strong=“H3581 H6113” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [to build]{strong=“H1129” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w him an house| strong="H1004" \w*, \w seeing the heaven| strong="H8064" \w* \w and heaven| strong="H8064" \w* \w of heavens| strong="H8064" \w* [cannot contain]{strong=“H3557” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8770”} him? who am [I then, that I should build]{strong=“H1129” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w him an house| strong="H1004" \w*, \w save only| strong="H518" \w* [to burn sacrifice]{strong=“H6999” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8687”} \w before| strong="H6440" \w* him?\f + \fr 2:6 \ft is able: Heb. hath retained, or, obtained strength \f* 
