\v 6 [Howbeit I believed]{strong=“H539” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w not their words| strong="H1697" \w*, [until I came]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, \w and mine eyes| strong="H5869" \w* [had seen]{strong=“H7200” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} it: [and, behold, the one half]{strong=“H2677”} \w of the greatness| strong="H4768" \w* \w of thy wisdom| strong="H2451" \w* [was not told]{strong=“H5046” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8717”} me: for [thou exceedest]{strong=“H3254” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w the fame| strong="H8052" \w* [that I heard]{strong=“H8085” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}. 
