\c 15
\p 
\v 1 \w And the Spirit| strong="H7307" \w* \w of God| strong="H430" \w* \w came upon Azariah| strong="H5838" \w* \w the son| strong="H1121" \w* \w of Oded| strong="H5752" \w*: 
