\v 19 And there was no more \w war| strong="H4421" \w* \w unto the five| strong="H2568" \w* \w and thirtieth| strong="H7970" \w* \w year| strong="H8141" \w* \w of the reign| strong="H4438" \w* \w of Asa| strong="H609" \w*. 
\c 16
\p 
\v 1 \w In the six| strong="H8337" \w* \w and thirtieth| strong="H7970" \w* \w year| strong="H8141" \w* \w of the reign| strong="H4438" \w* \w of Asa| strong="H609" \w* \w Baasha| strong="H1201" \w* \w king| strong="H4428" \w* \w of Israel| strong="H3478" \w* [came up]{strong=“H5927” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w against Judah| strong="H3063" \w*, [and built]{strong=“H1129” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w Ramah| strong="H7414" \w*, \w to the intent that| strong="H1115" \w* [he might let]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} [none go out]{strong=“H3318” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [or come in]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w to Asa| strong="H609" \w* \w king| strong="H4428" \w* \w of Judah| strong="H3063" \w*. 
\v 2 \w Then Asa| strong="H609" \w* [brought out]{strong=“H3318” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w silver| strong="H3701" \w* \w and gold| strong="H2091" \w* \w out of the treasures| strong="H214" \w* \w of the house| strong="H1004" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc* [and of the king’s]{strong=“H4428”} \w house| strong="H1004" \w*, [and sent]{strong=“H7971” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [to Ben-hadad]{strong=“H1130”} \w king| strong="H4428" \w* \w of Syria| strong="H758" \w*, [that dwelt]{strong=“H3427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w at Damascus| strong="H1834" \w*, [saying]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”},\f + \fr 16:2 \ft Damascus: Heb. Darmesek \f* 
\v 3 There is \w a league| strong="H1285" \w* between me and thee, as there was \w between my father| strong="H1" \w* \w and thy father| strong="H1" \w*: [behold, I have sent]{strong=“H7971” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w thee silver| strong="H3701" \w* \w and gold| strong="H2091" \w*; [go]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”}, [break]{strong=“H6565” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8685”} \w thy league| strong="H1285" \w* \w with Baasha| strong="H1201" \w* \w king| strong="H4428" \w* \w of Israel| strong="H3478" \w*, [that he may depart]{strong=“H5927” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} from me. 
\v 4 [And Ben-hadad]{strong=“H1130”} [hearkened]{strong=“H8085” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w unto king| strong="H4428" \w* \w Asa| strong="H609" \w*, [and sent]{strong=“H7971” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the captains| strong="H8269" \w* \w of his armies| strong="H2428" \w* \w against the cities| strong="H5892" \w* \w of Israel| strong="H3478" \w*; [and they smote]{strong=“H5221” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w Ijon| strong="H5859" \w*, \w and Dan| strong="H1835" \w*, [and Abel-maim]{strong=“H66”}, \w and all the store| strong="H4543" \w* \w cities| strong="H5892" \w* \w of Naphtali| strong="H5321" \w*.\f + \fr 16:4 \ft his: Heb. which were his \f* 
\v 5 [And it came to pass, when Baasha]{strong=“H1201”} [heard]{strong=“H8085” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} it, [that he left off]{strong=“H2308” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [building]{strong=“H1129” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w of Ramah| strong="H7414" \w*, \w and let his work| strong="H4399" \w* [cease]{strong=“H7673” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”}. 
