\v 6 [And he returned]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [to be healed]{strong=“H7495” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8692”} \w in Jezreel| strong="H3157" \w* \w because of the wounds| strong="H4347" \w* [which were given]{strong=“H5221” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w him at Ramah| strong="H7414" \w*, [when he fought]{strong=“H3898” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8736”} \w with Hazael| strong="H2371" \w* \w king| strong="H4428" \w* \w of Syria| strong="H758" \w*. \w And Azariah| strong="H5838" \w* \w the son| strong="H1121" \w* \w of Jehoram| strong="H3088" \w* \w king| strong="H4428" \w* \w of Judah| strong="H3063" \w* [went down]{strong=“H3381” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [to see]{strong=“H7200” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w Jehoram| strong="H3088" \w* \w the son| strong="H1121" \w* \w of Ahab| strong="H256" \w* \w at Jezreel| strong="H3157" \w*, [because he was sick]{strong=“H2470” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}.\f + \fr 22:6 \ft which…: Heb. wherewith they wounded him \f* \f + \fr 22:6 \ft Azariah: also called, Ahaziah, or, Jehoahaz \f* 
\v 7 \w And the destruction| strong="H8395" \w* \w of Ahaziah| strong="H274" \w* \w was of God| strong="H430" \w* [by coming]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w to Joram| strong="H3141" \w*: [for when he was come]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, [he went out]{strong=“H3318” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w with Jehoram| strong="H3088" \w* \w against Jehu| strong="H3058" \w* \w the son| strong="H1121" \w* \w of Nimshi| strong="H5250" \w*, whom the \sc Lord\sc* [had anointed]{strong=“H4886” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [to cut off]{strong=“H3772” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8687”} \w the house| strong="H1004" \w* \w of Ahab| strong="H256" \w*.\f + \fr 22:7 \ft destruction: Heb. treading down \f* 
