\v 9 [And he sought]{strong=“H1245” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w Ahaziah| strong="H274" \w*: [and they caught]{strong=“H3920” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [him, (for he was hid]{strong=“H2244” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8693”} \w in Samaria| strong="H8111" \w*,) [and brought]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w him to Jehu| strong="H3058" \w*: [and when they had slain]{strong=“H4191” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} [him, they buried]{strong=“H6912” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [him: Because, said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} they, he is \w the son| strong="H1121" \w* \w of Jehoshaphat| strong="H3092" \w*, [who sought]{strong=“H1875” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} the \sc Lord\sc* \w with all his heart| strong="H3824" \w*. \w So the house| strong="H1004" \w* \w of Ahaziah| strong="H274" \w* \w had no power| strong="H3581" \w* [to keep]{strong=“H6113” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w still the kingdom| strong="H4467" \w*. 
\p
