\v 2 [And they went about]{strong=“H5437” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w in Judah| strong="H3063" \w*, [and gathered]{strong=“H6908” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the Levites| strong="H3881" \w* \w out of all the cities| strong="H5892" \w* \w of Judah| strong="H3063" \w*, \w and the chief| strong="H7218" \w* \w of the fathers| strong="H1" \w* \w of Israel| strong="H3478" \w*, [and they came]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w to Jerusalem| strong="H3389" \w*. 
