\p
\v 13 \w But the soldiers| strong="H1121" \w* \w of the army| strong="H1416" \w* \w which Amaziah| strong="H558" \w* [sent back]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”}, [that they should not go]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w with him to battle| strong="H4421" \w*, [fell]{strong=“H6584” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w upon the cities| strong="H5892" \w* \w of Judah| strong="H3063" \w*, \w from Samaria| strong="H8111" \w* [even unto Beth-horon]{strong=“H1032”}, [and smote]{strong=“H5221” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w three| strong="H7969" \w* \w thousand| strong="H505" \w* [of them, and took]{strong=“H962” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w much| strong="H7227" \w* \w spoil| strong="H961" \w*.\f + \fr 25:13 \ft the soldiers…: Heb. the sons of the band \f* 
\p
