\v 16 [And it came to pass, as he talked]{strong=“H1696” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8763”} with him, that the king [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [unto him, Art thou made]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [of the king’s]{strong=“H4428”} [counsel]{strong=“H3289” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}? [forbear]{strong=“H2308” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”}; [why shouldest thou be smitten]{strong=“H5221” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”}? \w Then the prophet| strong="H5030" \w* [forbare]{strong=“H2308” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [and said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [I know]{strong=“H3045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w that God| strong="H430" \w* [hath determined]{strong=“H3289” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [to destroy]{strong=“H7843” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8687”} [thee, because thou hast done]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [this, and hast not hearkened]{strong=“H8085” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w unto my counsel| strong="H6098" \w*.\f + \fr 25:16 \ft determined: Heb. counselled \f* 
\p
