\v 8 [Now be ye not stiffnecked]{strong=“H6203 H7185” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”}, \w as your fathers| strong="H1" \w* were, but [yield]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w yourselves| strong="H3027" \w* unto the \sc Lord\sc*, [and enter]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w into his sanctuary| strong="H4720" \w*, [which he hath sanctified]{strong=“H6942” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w for ever| strong="H5769" \w*: [and serve]{strong=“H5647” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} the \sc Lord\sc* \w your God| strong="H430" \w*, \w that the fierceness| strong="H2740" \w* \w of his wrath| strong="H639" \w* [may turn away]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} from you.\f + \fr 30:8 \ft be ye…: Heb. harden not your necks \f* \f + \fr 30:8 \ft yield…: Heb. give the hand \f* 
\v 9 [For if ye turn again]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} unto the \sc Lord\sc*, \w your brethren| strong="H251" \w* \w and your children| strong="H1121" \w* shall find \w compassion| strong="H7356" \w* \w before| strong="H6440" \w* [them that lead them captive]{strong=“H7617” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}, [so that they shall come again]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w into this land| strong="H776" \w*: for the \sc Lord\sc* \w your God| strong="H430" \w* is \w gracious| strong="H2587" \w* \w and merciful| strong="H7349" \w*, [and will not turn away]{strong=“H5493” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} his \w face| strong="H6440" \w* [from you, if ye return]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} unto him. 
