\p
\v 22 \w Now in the first| strong="H259" \w* \w year| strong="H8141" \w* \w of Cyrus| strong="H3566" \w* \w king| strong="H4428" \w* \w of Persia| strong="H6539" \w*, \w that the word| strong="H1697" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc* spoken \w by the mouth| strong="H6310" \w* \w of Jeremiah| strong="H3414" \w* [might be accomplished]{strong=“H3615” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, the \sc Lord\sc* [stirred up]{strong=“H5782” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w the spirit| strong="H7307" \w* \w of Cyrus| strong="H3566" \w* \w king| strong="H4428" \w* \w of Persia| strong="H6539" \w*, [that he made a proclamation]{strong=“H6963 H5674” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w throughout all his kingdom| strong="H4438" \w*, and put it \w also in writing| strong="H4385" \w*, [saying]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, 
\v 23 [Thus saith]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w Cyrus| strong="H3566" \w* \w king| strong="H4428" \w* \w of Persia| strong="H6539" \w*, \w All the kingdoms| strong="H4467" \w* \w of the earth| strong="H776" \w* hath the \sc Lord\sc* \w God| strong="H430" \w* \w of heaven| strong="H8064" \w* [given]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [me; and he hath charged]{strong=“H6485” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [me to build]{strong=“H1129” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w him an house| strong="H1004" \w* \w in Jerusalem| strong="H3389" \w*, which is \w in Judah| strong="H3063" \w*. Who is there \w among you of all his people| strong="H5971" \w*? The \sc Lord\sc* \w his God| strong="H430" \w* be [with him, and let him go up]{strong=“H5927” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}. 